  "prefLabel": "Bar 601.03 Personal use",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bar 601.03 “Personal use” means tanning devices which are limited exclusively to an individual and this individual’s immediate family.\n\nSource. #8444, eff 10-06-05, EXPIRED: 10-6-13\n\nNew. #10808, eff 4-2-15, EXPIRED: 4-1-25\n\nNew. #14271, INTERIM, eff 6-16-25, EXPIRES: 12-14-25; ss by #14591, eff 7-17-26, EXPIRES: 7-17-36",
